    A Google sign-in that did not complete (FR-AUTH-04a; SDD v1.1 §5.6). One
    page for every cause — an expired or reused link, a refused token, an email
    Google has not verified, or an email already used by an account — so it
    says nothing about which, and nothing about any account. The cause is
    logged, never shown. DYNAMIC (private, no-store). %>
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head', { title: title }) %>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="page account">
    <% if (cancelled) { %>
      <h1>Google sign-in was not completed</h1>
      <p class="lede" role="status">Nothing was changed. You can try again, or sign in another way.</p>
    <% } else { %>
      <h1>We couldn't sign you in with Google</h1>
      <p class="lede" role="status">Nothing was changed. Please try again. If you already have a PronounceAll account, sign in with your username or email.</p>
    <% } %>
    <p><a class="button" href="/login">Back to sign in</a></p>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <script type="module" src="/js/bootstrap.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
